Completed so far:

1. Project folders, Supabase clients, and all 20 database migrations are working.
2. Users table has a role column: admin, teacher, or student.
3. middleware.ts checks login status and role on every page request, blocks deactivated accounts.
4. lib/auth/get-current-user.ts gives pages requireUser and requireRole to check who is logged in.
5. lib/auth/AUTH_NOTES.md explains the reasoning behind the auth code so other files can just link to it.
6. RC01 (login guard) is complete.
7. RC03 is complete. Built features/quizzes/actions/get-quiz-for-student.ts, which only reads safe quiz data through the answer_options_for_student view so correct answers never reach a student's browser before they submit. Also built features/quizzes/actions/grade-quiz-submission.ts, which grades quiz answers on the server using the admin client and only returns a score, never the answer key.
8. Saved the school logo to public/logo.png as the app's default logo.
9. Built app/(auth)/login/page.tsx using the DESIGN LMS.md wireframe and color tokens.
10. Built features/auth/actions/login.ts, the server action that checks email and password with Supabase, confirms the account is active, then sends the person to their role's dashboard.
